  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Generator Refactor Validation Hardening\n\n      This release focuses on structural clarity, validation robustness, and long-term maintainability.\n\n      Refactored Analyze pipeline:\n      - Clear phase-based orchestration:\n      * Option resolution\n      * Handler discovery\n      * Pipeline extraction\n      * Validation context construction\n      - Introduced PipelineFacts aggregation model\n      - Reordered Generator methods for top-to-bottom readability:\n      Initialize -> Execute -> Analyze -> Validate -> Emit\n      - No behavioral changes\n      - All tests remain green\n\n      New validation: Missing Handler Detection\n      - DISP410: Middleware configured for a command without a handler\n      - DISP411: Policy targets a command without a handler\n\n      Internal improvements:\n      - Clearer validation layering\n      - Cleaner responsibility boundaries\n      - Minor allocation reductions\n      - Improved determinism and readability\n\n      Next steps toward v1.0:\n\n      We are entering a focused file-by-file polishing phase.\n      The goal is to review every component for clarity, consistency,\n      diagnostic quality, and long-term maintainability.\n\n      No major features are planned before v1.0.\n      The focus is stability, readability, and API confidence.\n\n      v1.0 will be released once the generator reaches\n      a level of simplicity and determinism we are fully satisfied with.",
